   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "Los meses llevan **mayúscula**. Para decir en qué mes ocurre algo usamos **in**: **in July**, **in December**.",
     "@en": "The months have been **mayúscula**. To tell you what month something happens we use **in**: **in July**, **in December**."
